OL,3,GNEWSAICU pillow device aids care of
OL,4,Asickest patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrials of an inflatable pillow
OL,7,Fdeveloped to make moving ventilated
OL,8,Fpatients lying on their front easier
OL,9,Fand safer have found it reduces the
OL,10,Fdemands on ICU teams.
OL,12,FThe BathMat was created by the
OL,13,FUniversity of Bath and Royal United
OL,14,FHospitals (RUH) to be used under a
OL,15,Fprone patient's chest and abdomen to
OL,16,Fraise them.
OL,18,FPatients lying prone have to be
OL,19,Frepositioned up to seven times a day
OL,20,Fand preliminary findings showed the
OL,21,Fdevice cut the number of staff needed
OL,22,Ffrom five to three.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
