OL,3,GNEWSAICU pillow device aids care of
OL,4,Asickest patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Alexander Lunt, senior lecturer at
OL,7,Fthe university said the device was
OL,8,Finspired by ICU teams' experiences
OL,9,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic which
OL,10,Fremain relevant as they "continue to
OL,11,Foperate under significant workforce
OL,12,Fpressure".
